      "sourceQuote": "EventBridge Pipes is not supported.",
      "rationale": "AWS documents Amazon EventBridge in AWS GovCloud and identifies unsupported features, including API Gateway event-bus targets, API destinations, and EventBridge Pipes. Availability is therefore proposed as Limited rather than Full.",
      "proposedOn": "2026-06-16"
    },
